{"lang": "zh_CN", "eventid": "act54side", "eventName": "月行水上", "entryType": "ACTIVITY", "storyCode": "SR-7", "avgTag": "行动前", "storyName": "月悬", "storyInfo": "葬礼前日，吉阿达失踪了。结城理等人前往殡仪堂，见到了强颜欢笑、实则十分担心吉阿达的裘里奥。结城理等人尝试寻找吉阿达未果，却从博士那里得知，博士或许推测出了怪物出现的真正原因……", "storyList": [{"id": 0, "prop": "HEADER", "attributes": {"key": "title_test", "is_skippable": "true", "fit_mode": "BLACK_MASK"}}, {"id": 1, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 2, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 3, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 4, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "77_g9_gate", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 5, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 6, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 7, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 8, "prop": "PlayMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$normal_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 9, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#5$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 10, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……珀拉！太好了，你见到吉阿达了吗？", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#5$1"}, {"id": 11, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1253_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 12, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "都九点半了，她应该已经在准备室了吧。", "name": "珀拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1253_1#1$1"}, {"id": 13, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 14, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……我在准备室等了很久了，她没来。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1"}, {"id": 15, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#12$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 16, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "今天，是殡仪堂的工作日吧？她请假了……？", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#12$1"}, {"id": 17, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1253_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 18, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "珀拉", "content": "我看看……"}}, {"id": 19, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "珀拉", "content": "好像没有。是不是耽搁了，今天司提望区的公交线路出状况了？"}}, {"id": 20, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1253_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 21, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你别着急，明天就是葬礼，吉阿达不可能不来的。也许就是加班晚了点，睡过头了。", "name": "珀拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1253_1#1$1"}, {"id": 22, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 23, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1"}, {"id": 24, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1253_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 25, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你有急事要和吉阿达商量吗？", "name": "珀拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1253_1#1$1"}, {"id": 26, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 27, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "也没有……我能处理。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1"}, {"id": 28, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 29, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "只是吉阿达从来没有迟到过……我……", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1"}, {"id": 30, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1253_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 31, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "喔哟。你们吵架了？", "name": "珀拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1253_1#1$1"}, {"id": 32, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 33, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我们天天都在吵架啊，珀拉姐姐。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1"}, {"id": 34, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1253_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 35, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那不就是了。她一想到上班又得吵架，突然就不想起床了，“再睡两个小时吧！”——你觉得有没有这种可能？", "name": "珀拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1253_1#1$1"}, {"id": 36, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#12$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 37, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……珀拉，你是在说自己吧？", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#12$1"}, {"id": 38, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1253_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 39, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "珀拉", "content": "人不想上班是最正常的事了。"}}, {"id": 40, "prop": "multiline", "attributes": {"name": "珀拉", "content": "你也别把她逼得太紧啦，吉阿达在六厅实习时就是我带，她自己逼迫自己就已经很厉害了。"}}, {"id": 41, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_1253_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 42, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我相信她。她不会在关键时刻掉链子的。", "name": "珀拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1253_1#1$1"}, {"id": 43, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "要是下午她还没出现，你再来找我，我帮你想办法。在那之前，你就稍微帮她担一担要紧的工作吧？她会感谢你的，就算她不说。", "name": "珀拉"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_1253_1#1$1"}, {"id": 44, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 45, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……好。我会的。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1"}, {"id": 46, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 47, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 48, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 49, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 50, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "77_g6_funeralhome", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 51, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 52, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 1.5, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 53, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 54, "prop": "PlaySound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_gen_walk_n", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 55, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#9$1", "focus": "m", "duration": 1.0}}, {"id": 56, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 57, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#12$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 58, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……理？怎么和大家到这里来了？", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#12$1"}, {"id": 59, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 60, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你们的实习已经结束啦，今天是学校的休息日吧？可以出门去玩哦。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1"}, {"id": 61, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4219_yukari_1#6$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 62, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "吉阿达小姐在吗……？", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#6$1"}, {"id": 63, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 64, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……唔，你们找她有事？我能转达吗？", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1"}, {"id": 65, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4219_yukari_1#4$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 66, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……也没有什么特别的事啦。我们昨天……来这里找东西时，遇到了在加班的吉阿达小姐。", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#4$1"}, {"id": 67, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她看起来……不是特别好。我们有点担心。", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#4$1"}, {"id": 68, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 69, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1"}, {"id": 70, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#7$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 71, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她……和你们说什么了吗？", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#7$1"}, {"id": 72, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 73, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……她和我们讲了，昨天你们俩争执的事。", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$1"}, {"id": 74, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 75, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……这样啊。谢谢你告诉我。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1"}, {"id": 76, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 77, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她很生气吗？", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1"}, {"id": 78, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2387_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 79, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "并没有……吉阿达小姐没有生气。她只是……看上去很累。", "name": "山岸风花"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2387_1#10$1"}, {"id": 80, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 81, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……其实吉阿达今天还没有来殡仪堂。珀拉说也许她需要多休息一会儿。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1"}, {"id": 82, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 83, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "明天就是葬礼了，还有不少事要处理呢。就算讨厌我，吉阿达也不会放着工作不管的，要是她不出现，事情不就任我安排了吗——", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1"}, {"id": 84, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#3$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 85, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "只要想到这一点，她应该就会以三倍铳弹初速降临殡仪堂了！到时候我给你们发个消息，别担心。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#3$1"}, {"id": 86, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 87, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "裘里奥呢，你还好吗？", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$1"}, {"id": 88, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 89, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我……？哈哈，怎么关心起我来了……我不是好好地在这里嘛，如你所见，光环闪亮哦。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1"}, {"id": 90, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#7$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 91, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#7$1"}, {"id": 92, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不过，如果——", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#7$1"}, {"id": 93, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 94, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果你们见到了吉阿达……能不能替我告诉她，我很感谢她完成了遗容修饰。我会一直在这里等她的。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1"}, {"id": 95, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "她是为这场葬礼付出最多的人，没有人能否认这一点，我也从未想过要这样做。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1"}, {"id": 96, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 97, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我还是相信，不论有多少分歧，我和她的目的是一致的——要将这场葬礼完满地展现给每一位来宾，即使是姨妈本人也会为此而自豪……", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1"}, {"id": 98, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 99, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯……对了，虽然今天不用帮忙，明天葬礼上，可以请你们来搭把手吗？", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1"}, {"id": 100, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我申请调了几辆告解车到现场服务，你们懂的，这种场合，临时铳械租赁什么的。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1"}, {"id": 101, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#12$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 102, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但告解车要明天才能到场，我准备了装饰，但担心来不及布置好……本来这是我的活儿啦，只是现在……", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#12$1"}, {"id": 103, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4219_yukari_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 104, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……吉阿达小姐一定会出现的。", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#10$1"}, {"id": 105, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 106, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯……", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1"}, {"id": 107, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唉，其实我是不是应该告诉她……这也是去年秋天以来，我接到的第一份工作？肯定会被她当成装可怜吧……没什么意义……", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1"}, {"id": 108, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2387_1#7$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 109, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那个……我记得，裘里奥先生之前是在国外工作？", "name": "山岸风花"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2387_1#7$1"}, {"id": 110, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 111, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "是啊。其实我搞砸得特别厉害。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1"}, {"id": 112, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "灾变发生那天，我正在一场派对上，光环碎掉的时候，所有跟着我唱生日歌的小孩儿都尖叫起来了……", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1"}, {"id": 113, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 114, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "你们绝对不会想听到那种可怕的“大合唱”……当然了，他们的议员父母也不想，我可敬的客户女士就更加不想。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1"}, {"id": 115, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 116, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "好消息是！这顶光环现在把自己拼回来了，圣灵在上，真得谢谢我们的律法吧？就算只是为了这件事，我也会祈祷祂安息的。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1"}, {"id": 117, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "坏消息是，从那之后，我一件工作也接不到啦。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1"}, {"id": 118, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#12$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 119, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唉，真是太丢脸了！明明以前小孩子都最喜欢我了！", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#12$1"}, {"id": 120, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4218_aigis_1#11$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 121, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "所以你不希望告诉吉阿达小姐，是害怕她觉得你丢脸？", "name": "埃癸斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4218_aigis_1#11$1"}, {"id": 122, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 123, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不……当然不会。吉阿达是个善良的人，她会觉得我可怜吧。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1"}, {"id": 124, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4218_aigis_1#6$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 125, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "觉得你可怜，不好吗……？吉阿达小姐觉得你可怜的话，就会温柔地对待你了。", "name": "埃癸斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4218_aigis_1#6$1"}, {"id": 126, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 127, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哈……埃癸斯，说得没错呢。但人也有不想被温柔对待的时候啊。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1"}, {"id": 128, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4218_aigis_1#11$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 129, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……？", "name": "埃癸斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4218_aigis_1#11$1"}, {"id": 130, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 131, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……有很多不同的情况哦。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#10$1"}, {"id": 132, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 133, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "以我们的情况，吉阿达也许会可怜我，但不会因此就放弃她的主张。她只是会更加痛苦地拒绝我。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1"}, {"id": 134, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "不要让感情支配你全部的心；有时要把感情装进盒子里，放到一边；人行事有各种依据，理性、责任、道德乃至自利、自保——", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1"}, {"id": 135, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#2$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 136, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这些是父亲反复要我记住的。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#2$1"}, {"id": 137, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 138, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我不知道我是不是完全明白了他的意思……现在，也不可能再问了。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#11$1"}, {"id": 139, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 140, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但我想做对的事，我也想相信吉阿达……她需要的也不是“温柔的对待”，她一定也和我一样……", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1"}, {"id": 141, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "当她亲眼看到这场葬礼，也许她会明白我，也会明白姨妈，会明白那个遗嘱意味着什么……", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#1$1"}, {"id": 142, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2379_1#2$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 143, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "珍重之事不会一去不返……不要在尝试挽留之前就否认这件事。", "name": "裘里奥"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2379_1#2$1"}, {"id": 144, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 145, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 146, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 147, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 148, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 149, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "26_g11_laterano_alley", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 150, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 151, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 152, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 153, "prop": "PlayMusic", "attributes": {"key": "$darkness_03_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 154, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4219_yukari_1#6$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 155, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……吉阿达小姐好像不在家。要告诉裘里奥先生吗？", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#6$1"}, {"id": 156, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 157, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "已经发消息给他了。", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$1"}, {"id": 158, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4219_yukari_1#7$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 159, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "应该不会那么巧，吉阿达小姐刚好出发去殡仪堂了吧……", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#7$1"}, {"id": 160, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2387_1#12$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 161, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果吉阿达小姐已经正常去上班了的话，应该会回复我们的消息吧？但现在好像完全联络不上……", "name": "山岸风花"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2387_1#12$1"}, {"id": 162, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "也许确实在休息……？或者，她想一个人静一静之类的……", "name": "山岸风花"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2387_1#12$1"}, {"id": 163, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4219_yukari_1#4$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 164, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……我还是有些担心。昨天晚上，那个强大怪物的气息在殡仪堂附近出现的时候，不知道吉阿达小姐有没有碰上它……", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#4$1"}, {"id": 165, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "就算它在吉阿达小姐眼前现身，吉阿达小姐也看不见……万一被怪物“接触”了的话……", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#4$1"}, {"id": 166, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "实在是太让人担心了……好想知道现在究竟是什么情况。", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#4$1"}, {"id": 167, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2388_1#13$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 168, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "这么说来，不知道博士那边调查得怎么样了呢……", "name": "天田乾"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2388_1#13$1"}, {"id": 169, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 170, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 171, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$phonevibration", "volume": 1.0}}, {"id": 172, "prop": "delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 173, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#9$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 174, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……正好。", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#9$1"}, {"id": 175, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 176, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "博士联络我了，约我们在甜食礼堂见面。", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$1"}, {"id": 177, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 178, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 179, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 180, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 181, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "26_g9_laterano_street", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 182, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 183, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 184, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 185, "prop": "playMusic", "attributes": {"intro": "$m_sys_act16side_intro", "key": "$m_sys_act16side_loop", "volume": 0.6}}, {"id": 186, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "前往甜食礼堂的路上，结城理发现，休息日的街道意外地有些冷清。"}}, {"id": 187, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "按照之前的印象，总觉得休息日的拉特兰城即使随处上演爆破派对也不奇怪。然而一路走过的街道几乎称得上安静。"}}, {"id": 188, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "薄而连绵的云在高空缓缓飘过，将阳光滤得柔和了许多，拉特兰洁白的城墙也带上了一点灰调。"}}, {"id": 189, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "难道拉特兰人在休息日更喜欢待在家里吗？原来不知疲倦的天使和飞鸟，也有静思与歇息的时候……"}}, {"id": 190, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "目的地近在眼前，他驱散了脑海中薄云般的浅浅思绪。"}}, {"id": 191, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "希望博士会带来好消息，他想。"}}, {"id": 192, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 193, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 194, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 195, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "77_g11_dessert", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 196, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 0.5}}, {"id": 197, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 198, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.0}}, {"id": 199, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 200, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "难得的休息日还来找你们，就请你们吃点心做补偿吧。不过，你们之前是一起去什么地方了吗？", "name": "班主任"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1"}, {"id": 201, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4219_yukari_1#8$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 202, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "因为昨天夜里发生了一些意料之外的事，我们早上就去了一趟殡仪堂，想确认一下吉阿达小姐的情况……", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#8$1"}, {"id": 203, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 204, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "吉阿达……我记得是你们在殡仪堂实习的指导执事吧。但你们说“夜里”……难道你们在夜间调查的时候遇到她了？", "name": "班主任"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1"}, {"id": 205, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 206, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯，是的。", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$1"}, {"id": 207, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4219_yukari_1#4$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 208, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "昨天的情况有点奇怪……", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#4$1"}, {"id": 209, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2387_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 210, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "昨天夜里，我感知到了一个非常强大的怪物的气息……我们一路追踪到它所在的位置，发现就在殡仪堂。", "name": "山岸风花"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2387_1#10$1"}, {"id": 211, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "但是到达殡仪堂后，并没有发现怪物。之前的那种气息也感知不到了……", "name": "山岸风花"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2387_1#10$1"}, {"id": 212, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2388_1#3$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 213, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果要说是被消灭了也不像……这些天来，就连能看见怪物的人我们都没有碰到过，更不要说能与它们作战的人了。", "name": "天田乾"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2388_1#3$1"}, {"id": 214, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 215, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那你们到达殡仪堂之后，还发生了什么吗？", "name": "班主任"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1"}, {"id": 216, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2388_1#3$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 217, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯……在那里，我们只见到了加班到深夜的吉阿达小姐。", "name": "天田乾"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2388_1#3$1"}, {"id": 218, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 219, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "那么，她有什么异状吗？", "name": "班主任"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1"}, {"id": 220, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4219_yukari_1#8$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 221, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "异状……也不能这么说吧。她只是……嗯，看起来心情不太好。", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#8$1"}, {"id": 222, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 223, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……", "name": "班主任"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1"}, {"id": 224, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "加班到深夜的话，心情不好确实也算不上异状。", "name": "班主任"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1"}, {"id": 225, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4219_yukari_1#4$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 226, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我们和吉阿达小姐搭话，她讲了一些和裘里奥先生为工作争执的事……然后她就离开了。", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#4$1"}, {"id": 227, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "今天早上，我们还是有些担心，就一起去了殡仪堂，却发现她没有去上班……", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#4$1"}, {"id": 228, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "然后，按照裘里奥先生提供的地址，我们到吉阿达小姐家拜访，发现她好像也不在家里。", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#4$1"}, {"id": 229, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4219_yukari_1#12$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 230, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "其实我很担心……虽然怪物的气息后来消失了，但是万一就像之前我们遇到的人那样，吉阿达小姐“接触”到怪物了呢？", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#12$1"}, {"id": 231, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 232, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……我知道了。", "name": "班主任"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1"}, {"id": 233, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 234, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "说起来，博士今天找我们是为了什么事呢？", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$1"}, {"id": 235, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 236, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我想再找你们了解一下，之前你们遇到的那位死者……就是那个醉酒的路人，他接触到怪物时的情况。毕竟你们是仅有的目击者。", "name": "班主任"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1"}, {"id": 237, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "他在和怪物“接触”之后，确实没有任何反应吗？不一定是身体受伤，其他方面的反应或者变化，有没有？", "name": "班主任"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1"}, {"id": 238, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4219_yukari_1#10$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 239, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗯……那位先生当时醉得很厉害，还一直在唱歌，除此以外好像也没什么特别的反应……", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#10$1"}, {"id": 240, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#2$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 241, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……等等，是有的。", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#2$1"}, {"id": 242, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#5$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 243, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "因为当时还不太熟悉这里，没有意识到那个问题——那个人是萨科塔，他的光环，在接触怪物之后变暗了。", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#5$1"}, {"id": 244, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "现在想起来，这段时间我们遇到过不少萨科塔了，似乎还没有见过谁的光环黯淡成那样。", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#5$1"}, {"id": 245, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2388_1#9$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 246, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "没错，是有这回事……我也记得！", "name": "天田乾"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2388_1#9$1"}, {"id": 247, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4219_yukari_1#6$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 248, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "咦……那萨科塔的光环变暗，是意味着什么吗……？", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#6$1"}, {"id": 249, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 250, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "……原来如此。", "name": "班主任"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1"}, {"id": 251, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 252, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "博士……？", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$1"}, {"id": 253, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 254, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "哦，先回答你们的问题。首先，萨科塔的光环形态各异，有的人天生光环颜色黯淡，不能一概而论。", "name": "班主任"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1"}, {"id": 255, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "其次，对于一个特定的萨科塔而言，光环变暗的情形……", "name": "班主任"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1"}, {"id": 256, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "轻者，心情低落就可能导致光环变暗；重者……堕天。", "name": "班主任"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1"}, {"id": 257, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2388_1#13$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 258, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "“堕天”是指……？", "name": "天田乾"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2388_1#13$1"}, {"id": 259, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 260, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "萨科塔失去身为萨科塔的资格，就叫做堕天。不过，堕天有着明确的发生条件，你们见到的应该不是这种情况。", "name": "班主任"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1"}, {"id": 261, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "排除极端情形，绝大多数时候，光环的变化与萨科塔的精神和心理状态相关。", "name": "班主任"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1"}, {"id": 262, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "刚好，我想和你们说的第二件事也与此相关。", "name": "班主任"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1"}, {"id": 263, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我想再了解一下，在你们的世界，人格面具，还有暗影，它们与“心灵”和“意识”之间的关系。", "name": "班主任"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1"}, {"id": 264, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "之后，我会和你们说说我的推测……", "name": "班主任"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1"}, {"id": 265, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "——关于出现在拉特兰的那种怪物，它们究竟是因何而诞生。", "name": "班主任"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2380_1#1$1"}, {"id": 266, "prop": "Dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 267, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 268, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 269, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 4.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 270, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 271, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {"image": "77_g13_street_dark", "screenadapt": "coverall"}}, {"id": 272, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 2.0}}, {"id": 273, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 4.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 274, "prop": "Delay", "attributes": {"time": 1.5}}, {"id": 275, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4219_yukari_1#6$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 276, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "怎么样，风花……能感知到强大怪物的气息吗？", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#6$2"}, {"id": 277, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2387_1#3$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 278, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "暂时没有……只有普通怪物，比昨天稍微活跃一点。", "name": "山岸风花"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2387_1#3$2"}, {"id": 279, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2388_1#3$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 280, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果那个强大的怪物没有出现，就在殡仪堂和吉阿达小姐住所附近调查……博士和我们说的计划，是这样的吧。", "name": "天田乾"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2388_1#3$2"}, {"id": 281, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4219_yukari_1#4$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 282, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "如果真的是Dr.{@nickname}说的那样，感觉情况有点麻烦了……", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#4$2"}, {"id": 283, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4220_kormr_1#5$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 284, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "嗷呜……", "name": "虎狼丸"}, "figure_art": "avg_4220_kormr_1#5$1"}, {"id": 285, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4218_aigis_1#2$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 286, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "虎狼丸，很担心呢。", "name": "埃癸斯"}, "figure_art": "avg_4218_aigis_1#2$2"}, {"id": 287, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_npc_2387_1#10$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 288, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "我也很担心……", "name": "山岸风花"}, "figure_art": "avg_npc_2387_1#10$2"}, {"id": 289, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4219_yukari_1#4$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 290, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "其实……如果那个强大的怪物，它的本质真的如博士所说……", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#4$2"}, {"id": 291, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4219_yukari_1#8$2", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 292, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "唉。但现在，光是担心也没有用……对吧。", "name": "岳羽由加莉"}, "figure_art": "avg_4219_yukari_1#8$2"}, {"id": 293, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4220_kormr_1#6$1", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 294, "prop": "playsound", "attributes": {"key": "$d_avg_dogbarknormal"}}, {"id": 295, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "汪汪。", "name": "虎狼丸"}, "figure_art": "avg_4220_kormr_1#6$1"}, {"id": 296, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {"slot": "m", "name": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$3", "focus": "m"}}, {"id": 297, "prop": "name", "attributes": {"content": "先解决眼前的敌人吧。一定会有办法的。", "name": "结城理"}, "figure_art": "avg_4217_makoto_1#1$3"}, {"id": 298, "prop": "dialog", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 299, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 0.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 0.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 300, "prop": "Blocker", "attributes": {"a": 1.0, "r": 0.0, "g": 0.0, "b": 0.0, "fadetime": 2.0, "block": "true"}}, {"id": 301, "prop": "stopmusic", "attributes": {"fadetime": 2.0}}, {"id": 302, "prop": "charslot", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 303, "prop": "Background", "attributes": {}}, {"id": 304, "prop": "Image", "attributes": {}}], "OPTIONTRACE": true}